# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Pestilent Spirit gives Blazing Volley deathtouch against multiple blockers.
# Forcing: Two reach creatures can block the menacing attacker; one damage from Volley kills both only with deathtouch.
# AI behavior: The opponent has no hand interaction and cannot block after the sweep.
# Failure modes:
#   WIN = Volley kills both blockers and Spirit attacks for exactly three.
#   LOSE = Attacking before the sweep leaves two reach blockers in play.
#   TIMEOUT = Spell resolution, deathtouch cleanup, or combat did not complete.
# Card roles:
#   Pestilent Spirit — grants deathtouch to the sorcery and supplies lethal combat damage.
#   Blazing Volley — deals one damage to each opposing creature.
#   Giant Spiders — require the deathtouch sweep before the attack.
#   Mountain — pays for Volley.
# Protocol path: ActionsAvailableReq, ZoneTransfer, DeclareAttackersReq.

[metadata]
Name:One Point Is Enough
Goal:Win
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:Turn one damage into a clear path for lethal combat.

